### Usage Examples

{% raw -%}
```jinja
{# Access a need by ID #}
{{ needs['REQ_001'].title }}

{# Link to a need #}
<a href="{{ ref('REQ_001') }}">Click me</a>

{# Loop over filtered needs #}
{% for need in filter("type == 'req'") %}
  <text>{{ need.title }}</text>
{% endfor %}

{# Pre-styled card #}
{{ flow('REQ_001') }}
```
